# The map's tiles (MapTiler). Optional: without it every address field still works and the map is
# simply not drawn.
#
# This one reaches the browser, and that is the design: tiles are fetched by the page, so no key
# can stay behind. Restrict it in MapTiler with "Allowed HTTP Origins" — the browser sends Origin
# and a page cannot forge it.
#
# It is NOT the key the API geocodes with. That one is server-side, in apps/api/.env, restricted by
# user-agent instead. Two keys, because the two restrictions cannot both apply to one: a server
# sends no Origin and is refused the moment any origin is listed.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_TILE_KEY=
